{1}{Greetings, noble hero. I've been waiting for you, we need men like you in this moment of a grave danger.}{Greetings, noble hero. I've been waiting for you, we need people like you in this moment of a grave danger.}{}{}{}{}
{2}{What happened, sire?}{}{5}{}{10}{}
{3}{Wha' you be talking 'bout, funny guy?}{}{-4}{}{10}{}
{10}{Our kingdom has been attacked by one of the largest orcish tribes - SahckKokk. Our towns and villages have sustained great damage, many people were killed, and provisions were destroyed.}{Our kingdom has been attacked by one of the largest orcish tribes - SahckKokk. Our towns and villages have sustained great damage, many people were killed, and provisions were destroyed.}{}{}{}{}
{11}{[more]}{}{1}{}{15}{}
{15}{Our soldiers bravely fought back, but we're short on men already. The castle was ambushed and... [he looks a bit dizzy] ... they kidnapped my daughter!}{Our soldiers bravely fought back, but we're short on men already. The castle was ambushed and... [he looks a bit dizzy] ... they kidnapped my daughter!}{}{}{}{}
{16}{[more]}{}{1}{}{20}{}
{20}{Then, a message from Kurduk, their chieftain, has come. He threatens to... to... oh, my god...}{Then, a message from Kurduk, their chieftain, has come. He threatens to... to... oh, my god...}{}{}{}{}
{21}{Please, my sire, I'm not sure I'm following you...}{}{5}{}{25}{}
{22}{Ho ho, dey be playin' with her, hurr.}{}{-4}{}{25}{}
{25}{He has threatened to do atrocious things to her...if I don't surrender [The old man starts to cry.]}{He has threatened to do atrocious things to her...if I don't surrender [The old man starts to cry.}{}{}{}{}
{26}{Is there anything that can be done, m'lord?}{}{5}{}{30}{}
{27}{Put yaself togethar, crybaby...}{}{-4}{}{30}{}
{30}{That's why I've summoned you. Since Kurduk is keeping my daughter as a hostage I can't order my troops to attack. We need a partisan like you to infiltrate the invaded territories and rescue my daugther first.}{That's why I've summoned you. Since Kurduk is keeping my daughter as a hostage I can't order my troops to attack. We need a partisan like you to infiltrate the invaded territories and rescue my daugther first.}{}{}{}{}
{31}{Are you sure this will work, sire?}{}{5}{}{35}{}
{32}{Mebbe dat too much, me no hero?}{}{-4}{}{35}{}
{35}{This is the only way! Distract their legions, and rescue my daughter. The reinfocements are coming from one of allied kingdoms in a few weeks, so we mustn't surrender by any means!}{This is the only way! Distract their legions, and rescue my daughter. The reinfocements are coming from one of allied kingdoms in a few weeks, so we mustn't surrender by any means!}{}{}{}{}
{36}{It will be an honor to follow such brilliant plan, sire!}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{37}{How much are you going to pay me?}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{38}{Me say 'kay den.}{}{-4}{}{40}{}
{40}{I'm giving you 1000$ gold now and you will get 10,000$ once you rescue my daughter. Now go, one of the generals is waiting outside the castle, he'll give you all necessary information. Also, take anything you want from these chests, you'll need that in the battle.}{I'm giving you 1000$ gold now and you will get 10,000$ once you rescue my daughter. Now go, one of the generals is waiting outside the castle, he'll give you all necessary information. Also, take anything you want from these chests, you'll need that in the battle.}{}{}{}{$$1000}
{41}{I must go, sire.}{}{5}{}{0}{lf1 1}
{42}{bah baai.}{}{-4}{}{0}{lf1 1}
{45}{Please make haste, we don't have much time.}{Please make haste, we don't have much time.}{}{}{}{}